'''Yeti''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Yeti''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{skill|fishing|level XXV (25)}} to be fished up. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Yeti''' is {{Green|100}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|1%|1|100|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
