== Trivia ==
*When a player kills the '''Yeti''' for the first time, they are awarded the "{{AchievementLink|Frozen Monster}}" Achievement.
*The '''Yeti'''<nowiki/>'s home may be an igloo.
**The {{Item|Pocket-sized Igloo}}, an item used to upgrade the {{Item|Baby Yeti Pet}} from {{Legendary}} to {{Mythic}}, references the '''Yeti''' by stating "Though far too small to be habitable, it reminds a certain creature of home."
*The '''Yeti''' previously had an OptiFine cape of the transgender flag.
**On November 1, 2020, Admin LeaPhant purchased an Optifine cape bearing the transgender flag for it.

